# SDEV WebAssembly Seed VM Specification & Binary Emitter — authored in SDEV.
#
# Defines the canonical binary layout and opcode tables of the SDEV Seed VM,
# and provides binary WebAssembly (.wasm) emission helpers (LEB128, section
# builders) written in 100% pure SDEV.

# ---- Memory Layout Constants ----------------------------------------------
# 0x00000..0x0FFFF: String pool (64 KiB, length-prefixed UTF-8 blobs)
# 0x10000..0x13FFF: Global variable slots (256 slots * 4 bytes)
# 0x14000..0x17FFF: Operand stack (u32 cells)
# 0x18000..0x1BFFF: Call stack (frames of ret_ip, saved_fp, locals)
# 0x1C000..0x2FFFF: Bytecode program (up to 80 KiB)
# 0x30000..0x1FFFFFF: Bump-pointer heap (~31.8 MiB)

to seed_mem_string_pool_base
  return 0
end

to seed_mem_code_base
  return 114688
end

